<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Wednesday both the common stock and preferred shares of Woolworth Corp were unavailable for news.</p>
<p>Huntway Partners LP, Axa SA, and Corimon SACA also were unavailable for after-hours trading, the NYSE said.</p>
</text>
